phone-gui
Copyright (c) 2026 the project owners.

phone-gui is a pixel renderer for the renderer slot (23-renderer-protocol.md):
the open image's renderer and the one the product renderer is compared with.
It is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 only
(GPL-3.0-only), full text in COPYING, and uses Slint under Slint's GPLv3
option. Whoever distributes it on a device takes on the GPLv3's duties there,
including the installation information of its section 6.

Contributions are accepted under the same licence, signed off as everywhere
in this repository (CONTRIBUTING.md).
